- 11 October 2026, measured: 372 of 372 Copernicus function nodes have an exact parameter table from Houdini and a SideFX web summary (status ok). The 12 names left over are network containers (dopnet, sopnet, vopnet...) and two Paint internals, which have no Copernicus page (HTTP 404). They are excluded and listed with reasons, not hidden.
- 11 October 2026, measured: three summaries (fractalnoise, streakblur, heighttonormal) re-checked against the live SideFX pages: all three match.
- 11 October 2026, measured: Substance Designer mapping written from the local Copernicus page (read in full) and the Adobe Experience League node reference; helpx.adobe.com returned HTTP 403. Status documented_only: 3 exact in purpose, 112 approximate, 22 without equivalent (generators).
